<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Churn Prediction Portal</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff7ed, #fde68a);
      margin: 0;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .box {
      background: white;
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      text-align: center;
      animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out;
      max-width: 90%;
      width: 400px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #1e293b;
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    p {
      color: #1e293b;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    a {
      display: block;
      margin: 15px 0;
      padding: 15px;
      background: #f97316;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 18px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }

    a:hover {
      background: #ea580c;
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(20px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <h1>Churn Prediction Portal</h1>
    <p>Welcome to the Churn Prediction Portal. This tool uses a Random Forest model trained on customer data to predict churn likelihood and provide actionable insights.</p>

    <a href="/predict_form">🔍 Customer-Level Analysis</a>
    <a href="/analytics">📊 Company-Level Analytics Dashboard</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
